[{"op":"set","variable":30001,"value":1920},{"op":"set","variable":30002,"value":1080},{"op":"set","variable":7120,"value":2},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i170"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"在那之后……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"追着我们过来的救援船，将我们救了上来。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"小堀田和其他人也都没事。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"大人们也不知道是该生我们气，还是该道歉。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"最终小堀田坐的那艘小舟，不知道消失到哪去了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"可能是沉了，也可能是被冲到了远海外面。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"明年祭典的时候，只能重做一艘新船了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"白羽的外公只对我们说了一句“抱歉”。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"今后，也许他会多理解我们一些。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"理解？"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"……到头来，连我自己都不知道那是什么。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"哪怕是白羽她自己也……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"白羽到底看到了些什么。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我突然想到。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"第一次来到这座岛时莫名地感到令人怀念。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"与之相反，对陌生的未来也可能会有莫名的感知。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"回想过去被称之为怀念的话，那联想未来的感情，会是什么呢？"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我想这点，只有她……鸣濑白羽才能得知。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"白羽在那之后沉睡了半天左右。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不过第二天起来时检查不出任何异常，就出院了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"出院时，我问了一下她当时的事。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"说她当时变得有些奇怪。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"而白羽只是茫然地说了句“我记不清了”。"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"set","variable":7120,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":2,"image":"i743"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i513"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"就这样，迎来了暑假最后一天。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"将乘坐今天下午的船，离开这座岛。"},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i187"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":2},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i187"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i68"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"……我将衣服，塞进行李袋中。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"差不多一个月。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我在这个房间住宿。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"留在这的时间比我计划中长了很多。"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i76"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11650"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“啊，羽依里。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11667"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“你做好准备了啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“是的。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“承蒙关照了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11670"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“不客气，没能帮上什么忙真抱歉啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“最终我还是一点忙都没帮上。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11685"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“帮什么？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“整理仓库。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11674"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“哦。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11673"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“说来你好像是为此而来的。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“是啊。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11667"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“我还以为只是来玩的。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“是镜子阿姨你来信问，能不能过来帮忙的。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11670"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“啊哈哈，的确是。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11667"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“本来，我也不只是想找人帮忙才叫你来的。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“咦……那是为什么？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11650"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“你不记得了吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11647"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“以前，我见过你的。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“以前吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"也许是真有过这事，但我已经完全没有印象了。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11667"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“嗯。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“呃……唔。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"果然还是想不起来。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11687"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“呵呵。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11686"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“我跟你说这座岛是个好地方，有机会就来玩吧。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11674"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“然后你那双眼就闪出光来了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11673"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“对我来说，我只是想完成这个约定而已。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“对不起……我没印象了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11686"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“我就知道。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“不过，还是谢谢。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11670"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“不客气。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“啊，对了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“怎么不见羽未？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11666"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“前些天午后她就走了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11667"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“就祭典那天。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“唉唉唉唉？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“都不打声招呼吗。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11666"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“没跟你说啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“有点受打击了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“明明是在一起生活的人，要走连声招呼都不打。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“是不是讨厌我啊？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11667"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“呵呵。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11647"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“可是，她经常有提起你的哦。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“提起我？提什么？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11662"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“这是……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11664"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“秘密。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我在这座岛上度过了我的暑假。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"而羽未，是不是也有她自己的暑假呢。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"肯定有吧……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“那我也差不多该告辞了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11667"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“再等一会，会有公车从公所前过来哦。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“不了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我走过去。”"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i37"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"一个月前……我顶着盛夏的日晒和蝉鸣，走在这条路上。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"就像这样扛着大袋行李。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"肩膀上的重量毫无变化。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"当时，我顺着坡道往外婆家走去。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"而现在，是朝着大海前进。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"海面被阳光照得光芒四射。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"季节依旧是盛夏。"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i413"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"走到了港口。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"在那里……"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i2"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15044"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“真要走了啊。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i12171"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“总觉得你好像一直都在这里。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i12180"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“嘿，也许你有做岛民的素养。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15014"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“干脆就住在这里吧。”"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i10213"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“算了啦，待在这种乡下有什么意思。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“话说，怎么没看到野美希啊。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15038"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i10203"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i12174"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"她平时都是这群人的中心。"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i10285"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“她很不擅长这种场面。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“不擅长？”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i12159"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“会哭的。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15014"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“小孩子气嘛。”"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i10392"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“我想，她应该是在那看着。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"苍指向铁塔。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“还真是。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"有一个小小的身影在塔顶看着这边。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“喂。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我对她挥挥手。"},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":257},{"op":"clear","layer":513},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i158"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i11727"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"‘鹰原羽依里。’"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"扩音喇叭传来声响。"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i11695"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"‘回去之后，也要好好做人。’"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我会的。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"使劲挥手。"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i2"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"岛上的男孩A","text":"“师父，你要走了吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"岛上的男孩B","text":"“要回冈山了？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“回的不是冈山。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"岛上的男孩C","text":"“我不要你走。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"小鬼们抱住了我。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“噢噢。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"有点感动。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"岛上的男孩A","text":"“拜拜。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"结果走的也意外的干脆。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……哼。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"怕离别会伤心吗。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15038"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“喂。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15008"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“你背上好像给贴了什么东西。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"‘鉴定结果，130日元’"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“喂！做什么呢！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"岛上的男孩A","text":"“拜拜，要再来一起玩啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"跑掉了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"真是的。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"堀田","text":"“哥哥。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“啊，小堀田。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"堀田","text":"“那个。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"堀田","text":"“给你添麻烦了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“啊，没有没有。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“你没事就好。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"堀田","text":"“嗯……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"堀田","text":"“要走了啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“嗯。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"堀田","text":"“一路小心。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"小堀田好像在找什么一样东张西望。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"堀田","text":"“姐姐她……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"姐姐……说的是白羽吗？"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“唉？是啊，她在哪呢。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“她总是一个人乱转……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"堀田","text":"“……那个。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“嗯。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"堀田","text":"“那天。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"堀田","text":"“姐姐抱住我的时候。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"堀田","text":"“有一股妈妈的气味。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“是吗。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“也许，你妈妈当时就在身边吧。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“也许是你妈妈救了我们呢。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"堀田","text":"“嗯！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"堀田","text":"“……这个。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“唉？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"堀田","text":"“送给你。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"堀田","text":"“这是我给哥哥做的灯笼。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我还没死呢。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"堀田","text":"“可是。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"堀田","text":"“我希望你能好好回到家。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"堀田","text":"“然后下次盂兰盆节再来。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……明年啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“这我可不敢保证。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"堀田","text":"“喂喂。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“抱歉。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“不过，我肯定会再来的。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"堀田","text":"“嗯。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"堀田","text":"“说好了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“说好了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"……接下来。"},{"op":"clear","layer":0},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i190"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13455"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"……啊。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"……在远一点的地方，我看到了白羽。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"她就像当初那样伫立在港口，看着天空。"},{"op":"clear","layer":1280},{"op":"clear","layer":1536},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i2"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我慢步向她走去。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13370"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"察觉到我的白羽转过身来。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我们四目相对。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“哟。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13235"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“嗯。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13265"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13238"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“那个。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13277"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“辛苦你了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"她轻轻欠身，向我行礼。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“不不。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“彼此彼此。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13248"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“嗯。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"有些害臊地笑了起来。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"比起初次遇见她的时候，表情柔和多了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"刚遇见她时……对了，还对我喊死开。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"死开……很冲的一句话。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"是为什么呢。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我突然心生疑问，为什么白羽要那么生气。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"本来以为她就只是怕生而已。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"但想起那一夜的情况，感觉似乎不止如此。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"是不是有什么东西被我遗漏了呢。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"其实当时还发生了什么很惊人的事。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"但那时候我也非常慌乱，所以没注意到这样。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"现在回想起来，就感到很奇怪。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"在离开这岛前，我好像就要察觉到一件非常重要的事。"},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i187"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i187"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"image","layer":1795,"image":"i18201"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1003"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"对了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"当时在水里的白羽，好像想要躲起来。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"穿着泳装……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"泳装？"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不对，那是……"},{"op":"clear","layer":1795},{"op":"image","layer":1795,"image":"i18201"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1003"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1005"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"白羽穿的……是内衣。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我猜是夜里擅自跑进泳池的白羽，觉得没人就直接在泳池边换衣服。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"而意外的是，我傻乎乎地闯了进去。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"所以只穿着内衣的白羽，慌忙跳进了泳池中。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"说起来，当时我进去的那一刻确实传来了落水声。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"只穿着内衣的白羽，是因为我毫不体谅想继续聊天才那么生气……"},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i187"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1795},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i187"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i2"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“哎呀。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我仰天长叹。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13304"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“你、你怎么了？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“没……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“对不起。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13259"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“唉？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“就是，第一次见面的那晚。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13235"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“嗯。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“你……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“内衣。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13307"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13384"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"她的脸一下子染成了红色。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我当时没发现。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“还厚脸皮地想跟你多聊几句……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13390"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“嗯……脸皮真的厚。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“所以你才会那么生气的吧。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“对不起。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13426"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“那个……你现在想起来只会让我难堪。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“的确。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这怎么想都不是离别时该说的话。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13411"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"都怪我害得气氛变奇怪了。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13265"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“那个……”"},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1125"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1124"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“对不起。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“唉？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“结果，我还是连累你了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“可我不是还好好活着，也没受伤。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“话是这么说……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我是这么想的。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“你似乎真的拥有不可思议的能力。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“可是那并非诅咒。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“唉？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“该怎么说呢。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我拼命地思考要怎么来形容。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我希望自己的想法，能尽可能正确地传达给她。"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1126"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“所谓的未来就是一片漆黑，正常来说是什么都看不到的。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“你的能力就像能往那里射出一束光。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“差不多就是这种感觉吧。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“通过你的能力，我们才能得知那些关键的线索。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“如果没有你的预知，小堀田她也许就一去不复还了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“也许就是靠你的能力才救回她的。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“真是这样的话。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“那不是很厉害吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我是真这么想的。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"岛上的习俗，还有白羽背负的东西，我都无从得知。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"但是，我认为白羽已经……我们已经完成了一件重任。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“……”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1127"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“啊。”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1128"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“怎么了？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“白羽？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“啊……哦！”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1129"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“没、没什么。没事。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"她慌张地摆起手，将头低下。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“就是看到了一点未来而已。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“看到了什么，又是祸事吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“没什么，完全不是什么祸事……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"脸怎么全红了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“؟؟؟”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"良一、天善还有苍他们，在一边远远观望着我和白羽。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"除了他们几个外，还有不少我认识的人。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"小鬼们，小堀田，食堂大叔，硬朗的老爷子们。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"连镜子阿姨也不知什么时候过来了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这么一看，来为我送行的人还真够多的。"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1130"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"眼角有些湿润。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"太阳的光芒，真是刺眼啊。"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1127"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“你怎么了？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“嗯。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我想起来了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“想起什么？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“暑假的过法。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“已经忘了很久了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i187"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i187"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"在城里，我一直彷徨四顾。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"总想着，自己之前是怎么过暑假的来着？"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"一直……都没想起来。"},{"op":"image","layer":256,"image":"i25640"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i196"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10280"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"而如今，很神奇地，感觉能想起来了。"},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i187"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i187"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"image","layer":256,"image":"i25640"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i272"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11778"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"究竟是从什么时候开始忘掉的。"},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i187"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i187"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"image","layer":256,"image":"i25640"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i209"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15097"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i12145"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"明明是很纯粹简单的事。"},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i187"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":257},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i187"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"image","layer":256,"image":"i25640"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i249"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11547"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i15323"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"就是……我，超喜欢夏天。"},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i187"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":257},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i187"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"image","layer":256,"image":"i25640"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i239"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13112"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"为了想起这么一件事，我才来到这座岛。"},{"op":"clear","layer":256},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i187"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i187"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i2"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"舱内广播","text":"“本次客船即将出港。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"舱内广播","text":"“请持有船票的乘客，尽快办理乘船手续。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"船，即将出航。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“那就再见了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13253"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“嗯。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"刚想抬脚，又停了下来。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我犹豫了一下。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不过，我觉得还是该说出来。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"在这座岛上度过的夏天，总结出来的话。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"有两句。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我想留下这两句话再走。"},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1124"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我转身，面向白羽。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“？”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1126"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“那个。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“虽然时间不长但我过得很开心。”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1127"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“……哎？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“……”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1131"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“我也是。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“很开心。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……嗯。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“然后。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我。”"},{"op":"set","variable":30020,"value":90},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“喜欢上你了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1127"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“……哎？”"},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i187"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i187"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i158"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"就在出航的前一秒，我搭上了船。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"就好像一直在等我上船一般，轮船发出出港的信号，离岸而去。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我在甲板上挥着手……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"与岛屿一点点拉开距离。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"白羽一直呆站在原地。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"至今依然。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"啊……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"白羽从港口探出身来，向着我这边大喊着什么。"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1132"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“―――”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“――――――”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"在渐行渐远的船上。由于引擎声的嘈杂所以听不清她说什么。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我也从船上探出身子，大叫。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“你说什么!؟”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“我也!!”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“喜欢上――”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1134"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“你了！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"……"},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i187"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i187"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i154"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我想。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我一定会再回到这座岛的。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"舱内广播","text":"‘本船因机械故障需即刻返航。对各位乘客深感歉意。’"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“啊……？”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i158"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i13293"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“哎？”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i13309"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“为什么回来了!؟”"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1135"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我回来了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“欢迎回来。”"},{"op":"set","variable":3,"value":1},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":483,"value":["neg",20]},{"op":"set","variable":482,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":12019,"value":1},{"op":"set","variable":3,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"set","variable":23,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":19,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":20,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":21,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":7120,"value":0},{"op":"return"},{"op":"end"}]